      "description": "Junior Specialist (JPF02219) - AP Recruit Skip to main content Recruit Home Open Recruitments Junior Specialist (JPF02219) Junior Specialist Apply now to Junior Specialist Job #JPF02219 Life & Enviro Science / School of Natural Sciences / UC Merced Position overview Position title: Junior Specialist Salary range: See Table 24B and 24BN for the salary range for this position. A reasonable estimate for this position is $57,000 per year. 24B ) 24BN ) Percent time: 100% Anticipated start: September 2026 Position duration: 12 months Application Window Open date: August 14, 2026 Most recent review date: Friday, Aug 28, 2026 at 11:59pm (Pacific Time) Applications received after this date will be reviewed by the search committee if the position has not yet been filled. Final date: Friday, Sep 11, 2026 at 11:59pm (Pacific Time) Applications will continue to be accepted until this date, but those received after the review date will only be considered if the position has not yet been filled. Position description The Garcia Lab at UC Merced is currently recruiting a Junior Specialist for the 2026-2027 academic year. The Specialist will support the lab's research in soil ecology and sustainable agriculture. This will include assisting with soil and plant sampling in the field, processing samples, performing soil and plant health assessments, and organizing and analyzing data. The Specialist will also serve as the lab manager and oversee lab logistics, and health and safety compliance. Qualifications Basic qualifications Applicants must possess a Bachelor's degree in biology, environmental systems, agriculture, or a related field. Additional qualifications Attention to detail, strong organizational skills, strong written and oral communication skills. Laboratory experience in biology, environmental systems, agriculture or a related field. Application Requirements Document requirements Curriculum Vitae -   Your most recently updated C.V. Cover Letter Authoriz